                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                        "entry_id": "6b22d4fa-3a33-3f4a-b7fa-04d705bee882",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To make not private."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "80fd42eb-c115-4941-a01e-41dfe862d293",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "But the HP41 private mode was easily defeated. I still have my HP 41 and it's^([sic]) card reader. I was looking thru the cards recently and ran across one that is used to 'UNprivate' a program. Load the private program, then run the UNprivate card and the program is viewable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "befd243b-185b-426e-9ccf-43c02adfdc06",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "I run OS3.0 on a Vx. I put in a daily repeating floater to remind me to take a pill at a certain hour, and designated it as private, and it dutifully disappeared (I know I have to 'unprivate' it using the OS security, which is a bit of a bother, but at least don't have to see it all the time)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c80b9dfa-64a8-42e7-8f3c-72db63ac0d8b",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "When I set-up password protection for my user account on XP home I was given the option to make my files private to other users, which I did. I want to reverse the above action. I have removed the password easily but cannot work out how to 'unprivate' my files and make my files viewable to other users etc."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ee1acf7-da3c-47d9-8642-a1e8fd9b8aff",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "Therefore I dio^([sic]) not use fb [Facebook] to exchange anymore. Because if all I do is set priovate,^([sic]) the tablet unprivates it […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0591e582-cc9d-4e37-8648-56084a5a0916",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "While Shay has yet to make his official return to the web, or YouTube, he has since unprivated his Instagram page."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "42cf2868-32cd-4723-9bd0-08692982c466",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "Joshua has since unprivated his Instagram account to respond to Shannon’s accusations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "264e3725-5973-4d27-acec-21e90723fd8c",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "One user named @CodeNameNuclear explained on the video “predicting” Kobe Bryant’s death that 2020 Vision likely posted all the videos privately years ago and made sure that they included every single day in the year. Later, they could then trim the videos down so they only included the correct dates and make them public. “They posted it privately years ago, and they had the video an hour long going over every date possible,” they explained. “What they did was use the YouTube built-in trimming tool to trim it to the correct date and then unprivated the video.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1619047c-1391-461f-a7e1-40e2ce74a79e",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "It’s unknown at the time of publishing why the videos were unprivated. Speculatively the decision to unprivate the videos was made after internal discussion at Cover Corp but ultimately no formal announcement regarding the removal and subsequent return of the videos has been made."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8fed9b1c-d5b8-4793-9831-cf33892f3f45",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "How to unprivate a video on TikTok / Unprivating a video on TikTok is a relatively simple process, and you’re able to do it simply by heading to your profile page on the app, and going from there. […] Tap on the video you want to unprivate."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "edd6be68-e329-4939-a655-fdf109f490e1",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "“I apologize if this is crossing a boundary however I am desperate to get this the attention it needs,” she [Seara Adair] wrote to one TikTok employee, describing the “private posting” and the way she believes users are gaming the AI “by posting a black screen for the first few seconds” of these videos. “I personally saw one of the videos that had been unprivated and it was a child completely naked and doing indecent things. I reported the video and it came back no violation,” she continued."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c641173f-23c1-40c6-b34a-0e86bb5dcfce",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "L[ETA] ARMSTRONG: I know that if I, like, unprivated my account, like, so many random people would follow me."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ae424c6-f08c-46e2-b4c6-4285102c822d",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "Since then, there has not been much group activity, though Dani will occasionally reactivate or unprivate his Instagram account and update fans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0463dacf-5491-401c-9cad-3f2b5e043de0",
                                "sense_id": "265be994-4c18-3b3a-9cba-4f875b277d0b",
                                "text": "This time however, Sabrina unprivated her Facebook page, and overnight stardom befell the Decatur family."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
